    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-11-10T17:20:45+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-10T17:20:45+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-10T06:50:45Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-10T06:50:45Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A trough over the eastern border will clear into NSW overnight as a weak ridge of high pressure develops south of Bight by Wednesday. This ridge will persist into Thursday before a broad area of low pressure develops over SA on Friday. This low will track eastwards, making way for a new high pressure ridge in the west on Saturday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW014" description="North East Pastoral" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-11-10T15:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-11T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-10T04:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-10T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly clear. The chance of a thunderstorm with little or no rainfall north of Leigh Creek later this evening. Winds west to southwesterly 25 to 35 km/h tending south to southwesterly in the evening.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-11-11T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-12T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-10T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-11T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Winds southerly 25 to 35 km/h. Overnight temperatures falling to between 11 and 23 with daytime temperatures reaching 29 to 37.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">High</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:00am to 5:00pm, UV Index predicted to reach 11 [Extreme]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-11-12T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-13T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-11T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-12T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower north of Oodnadatta, near zero chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm north of Leigh Creek in the evening. Winds south to southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h tending northwest to northeasterly 15 to 20 km/h in the middle of the day then tending southeast to southwesterly 15 to 25 km/h in the early afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to between 12 and 24 with daytime temperatures reaching 31 to 36.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-11-13T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-14T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-12T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-13T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. High chance of showers south of Yunta, medium chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm. Winds northeast to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h tending northwest to northeasterly 20 to 30 km/h during the morning then tending northwest to southwesterly during the day. Overnight temperatures falling to between 18 and 24 with daytime temperatures reaching 33 to 40.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-11-14T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-15T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-13T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-14T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. Slight chance of a shower in the far northeast, near zero chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm in the morning and afternoon. Winds west to southwesterly 15 to 25 km/h tending south to southwesterly 25 to 35 km/h during the day. Overnight temperatures falling to between 17 and 25 with daytime temperatures reaching 31 to 39.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
